OL,3,GNEWSACow gives birth to triplets
OL,4,Adefying 100,000 to one odds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 13-year-old girl who has looked after
OL,7,Fcows since she was little has had the
OL,8,Frare pleasure of seeing one of them
OL,9,Fgive birth to triplets.
OL,11,FThe National Farmers' Union estimates
OL,12,Fthe chances of it happening are about
OL,13,Fone in 100,000. Sophie, who lives on a
OL,14,Ffarm near Baschurch in Shropshire, said
OL,15,Fit was "amazing".
OL,17,FShe has named them Tia, Tilly and
OL,18,FTiffany and said five-year-old mum
OL,19,FLucky Lady was doing well.
OL,21,FCows usually bear one calf at a time
OL,22,Fafter a nine-month pregnancy.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
